WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:03.698
To build your menu,

2
00:00:03.698 --> 00:00:06.998
open your venue and find the Menu tab.

3
00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:12.150
Evening Plates is already on the menu.

4
00:00:12.230 --> 00:00:14.300
Tap Add a category.

5
00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:16.453
Name it Mains,

6
00:00:16.453 --> 00:00:18.600
and add the line guests see.

7
00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:20.509
Then add the category.

8
00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:27.750
Mains is on your menu, so tap Add item.

9
00:00:27.830 --> 00:00:30.650
Name the dish, Lantern Burger,

10
00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:32.641
and set the guest price:

11
00:00:32.641 --> 00:00:34.200
twenty-two dollars.

12
00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:37.873
Add what it costs you. Only you see it.

13
00:00:38.413 --> 00:00:40.483
Let guests add a note,

14
00:00:40.563 --> 00:00:44.016
and choose where it is made: the Kitchen.

15
00:00:47.813 --> 00:00:50.683
Lantern Burger is now in Mains.

16
00:00:50.763 --> 00:00:53.803
Now edit the burger and add a choice.

17
00:00:55.013 --> 00:00:58.033
Ask the question: How should we cook it?

18
00:00:58.113 --> 00:01:01.633
Make it Pick one, and Required.

19
00:01:01.713 --> 00:01:03.695
Add three ways to cook it,

20
00:01:03.695 --> 00:01:05.413
then add the group.

21
00:01:09.963 --> 00:01:13.033
Next, a second group: Add-ons.

22
00:01:13.113 --> 00:01:16.439
Make it Pick several and optional,

23
00:01:16.439 --> 00:01:17.733
up to three.

24
00:01:17.813 --> 00:01:21.010
Each add-on can carry its own price.

25
00:01:23.313 --> 00:01:26.396
Both groups are saved on one dish.

26
00:01:28.413 --> 00:01:31.360
Late Bites gets a service window:

27
00:01:32.730 --> 00:01:35.600
ten to eleven at night, every day.

28
00:01:35.680 --> 00:01:37.598
On the Hibiscus Spritz,

29
00:01:37.598 --> 00:01:39.550
add a Make it group.

30
00:01:39.630 --> 00:01:42.267
A smaller portion can cost less:

31
00:01:42.267 --> 00:01:43.900
type a minus.

32
00:01:43.980 --> 00:01:46.987
Zero-proof is four dollars less.

33
00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:53.350
Build the rest of the menu the same way.

34
00:01:53.430 --> 00:01:54.915
Small plates.

35
00:01:55.930 --> 00:01:57.892
Mains, with sides,

36
00:01:59.580 --> 00:02:01.481
or make it a meal.

37
00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:04.375
Late bites with a heat level.

38
00:02:04.580 --> 00:02:05.887
Desserts.

39
00:02:07.080 --> 00:02:10.480
And drinks, with a spirit or a size.

40
00:02:11.947 --> 00:02:14.267
Then put your categories in order.

41
00:02:14.347 --> 00:02:16.267
Move a dish with the arrows,

42
00:02:16.347 --> 00:02:18.767
and you'll see Order saved.

43
00:02:19.247 --> 00:02:21.615
Mark a dish eighty-six'd,

44
00:02:23.447 --> 00:02:26.233
For this demo, ordering is on.

45
00:02:26.613 --> 00:02:28.897
Guests see the full menu.

46
00:02:29.413 --> 00:02:30.794
With ordering on,

47
00:02:30.794 --> 00:02:32.833
guests pick their choices:

48
00:02:32.913 --> 00:02:36.446
medium rare, bacon and avocado.

49
00:02:42.013 --> 00:02:44.222
A required choice must be picked

50
00:02:44.222 --> 00:02:46.483
before the dish can be added.

51
00:02:46.563 --> 00:02:48.383
And the price adds up:

52
00:02:48.463 --> 00:02:51.283
two items, fifty-three dollars.

53
00:02:51.363 --> 00:02:53.261
The burger comes to twenty-eight

54
00:02:53.261 --> 00:02:55.169
dollars with its add-ons.

55
00:02:56.813 --> 00:02:59.616
and it disappears from your public menu.

56
00:02:59.813 --> 00:03:02.251
Ordering is off by default,

57
00:03:02.251 --> 00:03:03.685
so your public menu

58
00:03:03.685 --> 00:03:06.090
shows dishes and prices.

59
00:03:06.347 --> 00:03:09.117
Everything also works on desktop,

60
00:03:09.197 --> 00:03:13.465
at host.usemingla.com.

61
00:03:14.247 --> 00:03:17.590
Edit a dish to change its price,

62
00:03:17.590 --> 00:03:19.112
cost and choices.

63
00:03:26.963 --> 00:03:28.479
With ordering off,

64
00:03:28.479 --> 00:03:32.386
your public menu shows dishes and prices.

65
00:03:36.347 --> 00:03:37.833
With ordering on,

66
00:03:37.833 --> 00:03:40.008
guests pick their choices,

67
00:03:50.613 --> 00:03:52.660
and the price adds up.

68
00:03:55.909 --> 00:03:58.700
One item, twenty-eight dollars.

